  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">BEING A MAN-Mentoring Boys, Empowering Generations</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Boys are like mirrors, and their lives reflect the world which we adults have created for them. There is the need to view boys as assets and resources, not as problems or liabilities. Our collective support is needed to cultivate them into becoming valuable, healthy, and thriving members of society. For us to promote and achieve gender equality, ensure the protection of women and girls and end gender-based violence and harmful practices, rigorous training and mentorship of boys and men is vital.</narrative>
  </description>
